  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two square-shaped coils, X and Y are in a uniform magnetic field. The magnetic field strength is B and both coils have a side length of <em>a</em>. Coil X is rotated 180<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{o}\"></span> about axis A and coil Y is rotated 180<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{o}\"></span>anticlockwise in the plane of the paper. A rotation takes 500 ms. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the average induced <em>emf</em> in coil X and in coil Y?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Average induced </strong><strong><em>emf</em></strong><strong> in X</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Average induced </strong><strong><em>emf</em></strong><strong> in Y</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>4<em>Ba</em><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{2}\"></span></td>\n<td>Zero</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>2<em>Ba</em><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{2}\"></span></td>\n<td>2<em>Ba</em><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{2}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>Zero</td>\n<td>Zero</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>2<em>Ba</em><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{2}\"></span></td>\n<td>Zero</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
